#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: oli-abandoned-cart-recovery.php
msgid "https://github.com/olivierbigras/oli-abandoned-cart-recovery"
msgstr "https://github.com/olivierbigras/oli-abandoned-cart-recovery"

#. Description of the plugin
#: oli-abandoned-cart-recovery.php
msgid ""
"Lightweight abandoned cart and pending order recovery for WooCommerce. "
"Captures the checkout email as soon as it is typed (classic and block "
"checkout), sends a sequence of reminder emails with unique coupons, and "
"tracks recovered sales."
msgstr ""
"Récupération légère des paniers abandonnés et des commandes en attente pour "
"WooCommerce. Capture l'e-mail dès qu'il est tapé au paiement (checkout "
"classique et en blocs), envoie une séquence de relances avec des coupons "
"uniques et suit les ventes récupérées."

#. Author of the plugin
